		{
			"rank": 200.0,
			"source": "check A1",
			"text": "Commander think tick median = 1.077 ms over 27 ticks (step memory). The worst step is `memory` in commander.gd `_think()`: cap its work per tick (a budget in usec, continue next tick), cache its group scans (AIWorldCache, ai-2v2.md:336), and move one-time setup / resource loads out of the first ticks. Commander counters: rule_usec_max / rule_usec_max_at say when it spiked.",
			"title": "Split the Commander's worst think step"
		},
		{
			"rank": 200.0,
			"source": "check H1",
			"text": "nodes were created under a VFX manager during the measure window (28 ({\"GPUParticles3D\":9,\"MeshInstance3D\":17,\"Node3D\":2})): pre-build them in the manager's _ready and restart them (art-units.md 8).",
			"title": "Pool the VFX"
		},
		{
			"rank": 101.5368,
			"source": "hot list: `scripts/units/unit.gd`",
			"text": "1.537 ms / frame over 94 nodes. shader parameter write (unit.gd:1948 in `_update_hp_bar()`, unit.gd:1949 in `_update_hp_bar()`). Fix: write only when the value changes (compare first) or move the animation into the shader (TIME). `scripts/units/unit.gd` `_physics_process`: run target acquisition / aggro scans every 0.2-0.3 s with a per-unit offset instead of every frame, use a spatial hash for nearest-enemy, and skip idle units.",
			"title": "Cheaper unit ticks"
		},
		{
			"rank": 100.5314,
			"source": "hot list: `scripts/ui/selection_panel.gd`",
			"text": "1.531 ms / frame over 1 nodes. string formatting (selection_panel.gd:564 in `_update_hero()`, selection_panel.gd:567 in `_update_hero()`, selection_panel.gd:580 in `_update_hero()`). Fix: build strings only when the text changes. `scripts/ui/selection_panel.gd`: refresh labels / bars on signals or at 4-10 Hz instead of every _process, and only set text when it changed.",
			"title": "HUD refresh"
		},
		{
			"rank": 98.7964,
